iv>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-94079a5 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"75342\" data-id=\"94079a5\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-66 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-159919a\" data-eae-slider=\"80251\" data-id=\"159919a\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-795385f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"795385f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Prenuptial Agreement in Lakewood, CO</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-799ede2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"799ede2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Entering into a marriage is a beautiful journey, yet the uncertainties of life demand careful consideration. A well-crafted prenuptial agreement can offer both partners peace of mind by providing a clear roadmap in case the unexpected occurs. It&#8217;s about protecting your assets and ensuring a smoother transition should your paths diverge. Connect with our Lakewood, CO, prenup lawyer today to initiate this essential legal process.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-96ef698 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"96ef698\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Understanding Prenuptial Agreements</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-add70b8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"add70b8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A prenuptial agreement, often referred to as a &#8220;prenup,&#8221; is a legal document that couples create before entering into marriage. Think of it as a personalized contract that establishes clear guidelines for various financial and property matters in the event of divorce, separation, or the death of one spouse.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a7e23d1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"a7e23d1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">What a Prenuptial Agreement Can Cover in Colorado</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e93ad67 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e93ad67\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Our Lakewood, CO, prenup lawyer can assist you in tailoring a prenuptial agreement that suits your specific needs. In Colorado, a prenup can cover:</span></p><ol><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Property Division: <a href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/family-law/divorce/property-division/\">Clearly outline how your assets and debts will be divided in the event of a divorce.</a></span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Alimony/Spousal Maintenance: <a href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/alimony-attorney-lakewood-colorado/\">Determine whether spousal maintenance will be paid</a>, the amount, and the duration.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Business Ownership: Safeguard business interests and clarify the division of business assets.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Inheritance Rights: Specify how inheritances will be handled, ensuring clarity and protection.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Retirement Accounts: Address the division of retirement accounts and benefits.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Debt Responsibility: Clearly state which debts belong to each spouse, shielding one another from potential financial burdens.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Customized Clauses: Include personalized provisions that address unique aspects of your relationship.</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">By engaging our Lakewood, CO, prenup lawyer, you gain the expertise needed to draft a comprehensive prenuptial agreement that reflects your intentions and protects your interests.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor