idget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">When to Consider a Prenuptial Agreement\n</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-93c78d4\" data-eae-slider=\"83957\" data-id=\"93c78d4\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-64d74ac elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"64d74ac\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">While every couple can benefit from a prenuptial agreement, there are specific scenarios where this legal document becomes especially crucial. Our experienced Lakewood, CO, prenup lawyer suggests considering a prenup if:</span></p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Either partner owns significant assets</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">There&#8217;s a desire to keep certain assets private</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Business ownership is involved</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Children from previous marriages are part of the equation</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Either partner is anticipating a substantial inheritance</span></li></ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-f22b974 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"85585\" data-id=\"f22b974\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-343d20a\" data-eae-slider=\"68534\" data-id=\"343d20a\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-398567f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"398567f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Securing the Legality of Your Prenuptial Agreement\n</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-2804984\" data-eae-slider=\"55989\" data-id=\"2804984\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-97f4510 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"97f4510\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Making sure your prenuptial agreement holds up in court is crucial. When you choose our Lakewood, CO, prenup lawyer, we provide clear and expert assistance on key components. The agreement needs to be in writing, with both parties willingly putting pen to paper. Exchanging complete financial disclosures is part of the process, ensuring that decisions are well-informed. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We are dedicated to preventing any form of coercion, which could jeopardize the validity of the agreement, and work diligently to steer clear of such issues.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-a4db373 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"53946\" data-id=\"a4db373\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-6c5a13b\" data-eae-slider=\"61495\" data-id=\"6c5a13b\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1da967a elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1da967a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Marital Agreements for Every Situation</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b915836 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b915836\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Contrary to common misconceptions, marital agreements aren&#8217;t exclusive to the wealthy. Business owners and individuals seeking to safeguard their assets and mitigate potential debts can greatly benefit. Unsure if it&#8217;s right for you? Consult our Lakewood, CO, prenup lawyer for personalized legal guidance based on your unique circumstances.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-9c4a616\" data-eae-slider=\"51450\" data-id=\"9c4a616\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-66b0bed elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"66b0bed\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Child Support and Prenuptial Agreements</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6179153 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6179153\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">While a prenuptial agreement can address various matters, it&#8217;s crucial to note that child support isn&#8217;t among them. Child support arrangements must prioritize the child&#8217;s best interests, evolving as circumstances change. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you need legal assistance regarding child support in Colorado, our family law attorneys are equipped to guide you through this distinct legal process.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-3376376 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"95559\" data-id=\"3376376\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-c15aec9\" data-eae-slider=\"57189\" data-id=\"c15aec9\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4524b36 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4524b36\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Why Hire a Colorado Prenuptial Agreement Lawyer?\n</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f0def0e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f0def0e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Some couples may consider drafting a prenuptial agreement without seeking legal advice, thinking they can manage it themselves. However, this is not only risky but can also be extremely problematic.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Prenuptial agreements involve complex details for proper creation and enforcement. The person drafting the document must adhere to specific rules and guidelines to ensure its legal validity. Failure to comply with all laws and regulations can render the document ineffective, leaving both parties and the intended protected assets vulnerable. Without a legally sound prenuptial agreement, couples might face complex divorce proceedings, legal complications, or substantial financial liabilities.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">At The Drake Law Firm, we simplify the process of creating your prenuptial agreement. Our expertise in this area enables us to craft a document that not only stands up in court but also effectively safeguards your assets in case of a divorce.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Embrace your future with confidence – contact The Drake Law Firm, P.C. Our seasoned Lakewood, CO, prenup lawyer is here to make legal complexities more manageable and ensure your assets and family&#8217;s well-being are protected.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t"
  },
